WEBVTT

00:15:55.631 --> 00:16:02.532
That the truth consists
of hard-to-vary assertions about reality

00:16:02.556 --> 00:16:06.396
is the most important fact
about the physical world.

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:10.640
It's a fact that is itself unseen,

00:16:10.664 --> 00:16:13.358
yet impossible to vary.

00:16:13.382 --> 00:16:14.571
Thank you.

00:16:14.595 --> 00:16:18.000
(Applause)